  },
  "conventions": [
    "Times are ISO 8601 with offset; compare instants, not strings. Grid math runs in UTC (whole-hour zones only).",
    "snap(t) = the grid mark g with g - 15 min < t <= g + 5 min.",
    "Event intervals are half-open [start, end): an event ending at 15:00 does not overlap one starting at 15:00.",
    "tapped_at = null in finish cases means the auto-finish job fired at planned_end + 5 min.",
    "Conflict and warning ID lists are sorted. Expected objects must match exactly (no extra keys).",
    "Events with status cancelled or missed are ignored by overlap checks and cascades."
  ],
